### PSS-10 Questionnaire Screen

#### [NEW] [QuestionnaireScreen.kt](file:///d:/stresssence/app/src/main/java/com/stresssense/app/presentation/ui/questionnaire/QuestionnaireScreen.kt)
- A modern Compose screen presenting the 10 PSS questions one by one.
- Features:
  - Top header showing current progress (e.g., `Question 4 of 10`) with a smooth linear progress bar.
  - Large, elegant question text.
  - 5 selectable option cards: `Never`, `Almost Never`, `Sometimes`, `Fairly Often`, `Very Often`.
  - Next/Previous button navigation.
  - A nice animated transition when moving between questions.
  - A final submit dialog showing the calculated PSS score, category (Low/Moderate/High), and button to complete the survey.

#### [NEW] [QuestionnaireViewModel.kt](file:///d:/stresssence/app/src/main/java/com/stresssense/app/presentation/ui/questionnaire/QuestionnaireViewModel.kt)
- Holds current question index and selected answers state.
- Formulates the PSS scoring logic:
  - Answers mapped to 0-4 values.
  - Reverse coding for questions 4, 5, 7, and 8 (indices 3, 4, 6, 7).
  - Multiplies raw score by 2.5 to map it to the 0-100 system.
  - Saves the result via `SaveScanUseCase` with `scanType = "QUESTIONNAIRE"`.

